   "id": 464023,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The NFL team's talent acquisition specialist is on a mission to find the most talented high school football player to join their team. The specialist is responsible for gathering extensive information on potential players, such as their stats, performance history, and overall potential. The objective is to pinpoint the standout athlete who will bring a significant advantage to the NFL team. To achieve this, the specialist utilizes cloud computing to sift through vast amounts of data and identify the ideal high school player who can make a valuable contribution to the team's success in the upcoming season. Why is cloud computing the perfect tool for collecting and analyzing data on high school football players?",
